---
import profile from '../data/profile.json';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<aside class="side" id="side">
  <img class="portrait" src={profile.photo} alt={`Portrait of ${profile.name}`} width="64" height="64" />
  <h1 class="name">{profile.name}</h1>
  <div class="role">Research Scientist and Postdoc, SkillBench and KAIST</div>
  <div class="bio">
    <p>I am a Research Scientist and Postdoc at SkillBench and <a href={profile.school.universityUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">KAIST</a>. I completed my PhD at KAIST in 2026 with <a href={profile.advisor.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Juho Kim</a> in <a href={profile.lab.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">KIXLAB</a>.</p>
    <p>I build AI systems that help people discover and develop their goals. I design interactive systems that <a class="tl" data-theme="expanding" href="#t-expanding">expand what people can draft and explore</a>, help them <a class="tl" data-theme="navigating" href="#t-navigating">compare alternatives and learn from them</a>, and <a class="tl" data-theme="modeling" href="#t-modeling">model how goals develop</a> to train and evaluate AI.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="links">
    {profile.links.map(l => <a href={l.url} target={l.url.startsWith('mailto:') ? undefined : '_blank'} rel="noopener">{l.label}</a>)}
  </div>
  <div class="side-bottom">© {year} {profile.name}</div>
</aside>
